## Canonical docs

1. **`pulse-web-otel/docs/instrumentations/integration/SPEC.md`** — integrate (exports, init, frameworks).
2. **`pulse-web-otel/docs/instrumentations/sdk-core/SPEC.md`** — lifecycle, consent, `pulse.type`, shared attributes.
3. **`pulse-web-otel/docs/instrumentations/<feature>/SPEC.md`** — one file per area.

## Non-negotiable rules

- Every signal must carry `platform = 'web'`. `pulse.type` and attributes: **`src/semconv.ts`** + **sdk-core SPEC** — do not invent wire values without an ADR.
- Public API: only **`src/index.ts`** (and published `package.json` `exports`).

## TypeScript (summary)

- Strict mode; ESM-first; CJS via tsup dual build.
- No `any` — use `unknown` + type guards.

## Testing (summary)

- Vitest + jsdom; **`yarn e2e:web-sdk-gates`** — **authoritative commands and patterns** live in **`pulse-web-otel-conventions.mdc`**.

## Size budget

- Run **`yarn size-limit`** before adding dependencies or large code paths; limits in **`pulse-web-otel/.size-limit.json`**.

## Progress tracking (optional)

- **`pulse-web-otel/web-sdk-plan/v1/MILESTONES.md`**.
